  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eliminating Hazardous Chemicals from Supply Chains in Mongolia (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Eliminating Hazardous Chemicals from Supply Chains in Mongolia. As described in the project child project concept note, this project seeks a safe elimination of POPs and Toxic Chemicals through the Fashion Supply Chain.</narrative>
  </description>
